{"t":"207940.KS","n":"Samsung Biologics Co.,Ltd.","nKo":"삼성바이오로직스","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":1290000.0,"chg":2000.0,"chgPct":0.00155,"prev":1288000.0,"dayH":1307000.0,"dayL":1260000.0,"w52H":1987000.0,"w52L":1150000.0,"vol":64585,"avgVol":55707,"mcap":62577279238144,"pe":null,"fpe":27.8,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":null,"divY":0.0,"beta":0.15,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Biotechnology","iKo":"생명공학","city":"Incheon","emp":5195,"web":"https://samsungbiologics.com","sum":"Samsung Biologics Co.,Ltd., together with its subsidiaries engages in the manufacturing, commercializing, distributing, and selling of biopharmaceuticals products in South Korea, Europe, the United States, and internationally. Its development services include late discovery, cell line development, process development, analytical development, and non-GMP / CGMP manufacturing. The company also offers aseptic filling, lyophilization, finishing, cold chain storage and shipping, and regulatory support services; and quality services and analytical testing services, such as IPC and release testing, stability study and testing, environmental monitoring, biosafety testing, as well as manufactures drug substance. In addition, it engages in the development and manufacture of antibody-drug conjugates ","sumKo":"삼성바이오로직스주식회사는 자회사들과 함께 한국, 유럽, 미국 및 해외에서 바이오의약품 제품의 제조, 상업화, 유통 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 개발 서비스에는 후기 발견, 세포주 개발, 공정 개발, 분석 개발, 비GMP/CGMP 제조가 포함됩니다. 또한 이 회사는 무균 충전, 동결건조, 마무리, 저온 유통 보관 및 운송, 규제 지원 서비스도 제공합니다. IPC 및 방출 테스트, 안정성 연구 및 테스트, 환경 모니터링, 생물 안전성 테스트와 같은 품질 서비스 및 분석 테스트 서비스는 물론 원료의약품 제조도 수행합니다. 또한, 항체-약물 결합체의 개발 및 제조에도 참여하고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":3001300000000,"ni":798100000000},{"y":2023,"rev":3694589000000,"ni":945920330000},{"y":2024,"rev":3497145680000,"ni":1083316000000},{"y":2025,"rev":4556971700000,"ni":1784352060000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":1285705780000,"ni":436506870000